            <ArticleTitle>Artefactual computed tomographic middle cerebral artery territory infarct.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>316-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report an artefactual middle cerebral artery territory infarct on CT scan. This anomaly is suggested by the discrepancy between the clinical and radiological findings. Awareness of this possibility may avoid unnecessary further investigation or treatment.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
